---
import DemoFrame from './DemoFrame.astro';
import GoPassByValueStepperDemo from '../demos/GoPassByValueStepperDemo.tsx';
---
<figure class="gpv-figure">
  <DemoFrame title="Step through a function call: value, pointer and defer" titleVi="Chạy từng bước một lời gọi hàm: giá trị, con trỏ và defer">
    <GoPassByValueStepperDemo client:visible />
  </DemoFrame>
  <noscript>
    <table>
      <thead>
        <tr>
          <th><span data-lang-en>Call</span><span data-lang-vi>Lời gọi</span></th>
          <th><span data-lang-en>What the function gets</span><span data-lang-vi>Hàm nhận được gì</span></th>
          <th><span data-lang-en>x in main afterwards</span><span data-lang-vi>x trong main sau đó</span></th>
        </tr>
      </thead>
      <tbody>
        <tr>
          <td><code>bump(x)</code></td>
          <td><span data-lang-en>a copy of 10</span><span data-lang-vi>một bản sao của 10</span></td>
          <td>10</td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
          <td><code>bump(&amp;x)</code></td>
          <td><span data-lang-en>a copy of the address of x</span><span data-lang-vi>một bản sao địa chỉ của x</span></td>
          <td>60</td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
          <td><code>defer fmt.Println("first:", x)</code></td>
          <td><span data-lang-en>x copied at the defer line (10), even if x becomes 99</span><span data-lang-vi>x được chép ngay tại dòng defer (10), dù sau đó x thành 99</span></td>
          <td>99</td>
        </tr>
      </tbody>
    </table>
  </noscript>
  <figcaption>
    <span data-lang-en>Pick a tab and press Next. Watch which box changes, and which does not.</span>
    <span data-lang-vi>Chọn một tab rồi bấm Tiếp. Để ý ô nhớ nào đổi, ô nào không.</span>
  </figcaption>
</figure>

<style is:global>
  .gpv-figure { margin: 2em 0; width: 100%; }
  .gpv-figure > .demo-frame { margin-bottom: 0; }
  .gpv-figure > figcaption { margin-top: 10px; font-size: 14px; color: var(--text-muted); line-height: 1.55; text-align: center; }
  .gpv .sd-group > span { text-transform: none; letter-spacing: 0; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 600; color: var(--text-muted); }

  .gpv-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1.05fr) minmax(0, 1fr); gap: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; }
  @media (max-width: 760px) { .gpv-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; } }
  .gpv-pane { border: 1px solid var(--border); border-radius: 8px; background: var(--bg); overflow: hidden; }
  .gpv-hdr {
    padding: 7px 12px; font-size: 11px; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 0.04em; text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--text-muted); background: var(--bg-alt); border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);
  }
  .gpv-code { padding: 8px 0; overflow-x: auto; font-family: var(--font-mono, ui-monospace, monospace); font-size: 12.5px; line-height: 1.6; }
  .gpv-line { display: flex; gap: 8px; padding: 2px 12px; white-space: pre; color: var(--text-body); }
  .gpv-ln { color: var(--text-muted); user-select: none; min-width: 18px; }
  .gpv-line.is-active { background: var(--gold-tint-bg); color: var(--text); font-weight: 700; }

  .gpv-mem { padding: 10px 12px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 10px; }
  .gpv-frame { border: 1px solid var(--border); border-radius: 6px; padding: 6px 8px 8px; background: var(--bg-alt); }
  .gpv-frame-title { font-family: var(--font-mono, ui-monospace, monospace); font-size: 11.5px; font-weight: 700; color: var(--text-muted); margin-bottom: 6px; }
  .gpv-cell {
    display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; align-items: baseline; gap: 4px 10px; padding: 5px 8px;
    border: 1px solid var(--border); border-radius: 5px; background: var(--bg);
    font-family: var(--font-mono, ui-monospace, monospace); font-size: 12.5px; color: var(--text);
  }
  .gpv-cell + .gpv-cell { margin-top: 4px; }
  .gpv-cell.is-changed { border-color: var(--gold); background: var(--gold-tint-bg); }
  .gpv-addr { color: var(--text-muted); font-size: 11px; }
  .gpv-val { font-weight: 700; overflow-wrap: anywhere; }
  .gpv-empty { color: var(--text-muted); font-family: inherit; font-style: italic; }
  .gpv-note { margin: 0 0 8px; font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.55; color: var(--text-body); }
  .gpv-out { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; align-items: baseline; gap: 6px 10px; padding: 8px 12px; border: 1px solid var(--border); border-radius: 8px; background: var(--bg-alt); font-size: 13px; }
  .gpv-out-label { font-size: 11px; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 0.04em; text-transform: uppercase; color: var(--text-muted); }
  .gpv-out code { font-size: 13px; color: var(--text); background: transparent; padding: 0; }
  .gpv-foot { margin: 8px 0 0; font-size: 12px; color: var(--text-muted); }
</style>
